<title>华为尊界刹车踏板断裂，官媒批“不说人话”被删；华为粉丝怒斥人民日报据港媒报道懂车帝发布测试视频，三辆全新尊界V800在时</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10332</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10332</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 03:09:53 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>华为尊界刹车踏板断裂，官媒批“不说人话”被删；华为粉丝怒斥人民日报</b><br/><br/>据港媒报道懂车帝发布测试视频，三辆全新尊界V800在时速100公里紧急刹车时，刹车踏板支架均断裂，且位置与形态高度一致；10日，新疆官方账号“新疆发布”发文促车企正面回应安全质疑，一度登上热搜榜首，随后却显示“无法查看内容”。“浙江宣传”指出，消费者“没有看到更权威的声音，却看到一个个帖子消失不见”。<br/><br/>11日，人民日报发文称刹车踏板“绝不应该在驾驶中出现‘断裂’”。学者魏武挥对《联合早报》称，此文意味着事件“上升到决策层”，预计华为或改变为合作企业深度背书的策略。<br/><br/>据李老师不是你老师截图，有华为粉丝怒斥人民日报为“汉奸媒体”“二流报纸”；另有自媒体批有媒体呼吁“给民族工业一点时间”，将质量问题升到了民族企业的高度。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80">#科技</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%94%B5%E5%8A%A8%E8%BD%A6">#电动车</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5">#审查</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%B7%B2404">#已404</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《香港01》<a href="https://www.hk01.com/%E5%8D%B3%E6%99%82%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B/60398343/%E8%8F%AF%E7%82%BA%E5%B0%8A%E7%95%8C%E7%85%9E%E8%BB%8A%E8%B8%8F%E6%9D%BF%E6%94%AF%E6%9E%B6%E6%96%B7%E8%A3%82%E6%83%B9%E8%AD%B0-%E6%96%B0%E7%96%86%E5%AE%98%E5%AA%92%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E6%89%B9-%E4%B8%8D%E8%AA%AA%E4%BA%BA%E8%A9%B1-%E8%A2%AB%E5%88%AA" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">华为尊界煞车踏板支架断裂惹议 新疆官媒文章批｢不说人话｣被删</a><br/>《浙江宣传》<a href="https://news.ifeng.com/c/8x9dfF9dIIE" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">尊界V800风波需要一个真相</a><br/>《人民日报》<a href="https://app.xinhuanet.com/news/article.html?articleId=202610112c9d9de0e4184f17ae8e24440c189a6b" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">四部门联手，对“速成车”说不</a><br/>《联合早报》<a href="https://www.zaobao.com.sg/news/china/story20261011-9819986" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">华为陷刹车踏板支架断裂争议后 中国官方整治“速成车”</a><br/>《李老师不是你老师》<a href="https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2109584874382168272" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">10月11日，《人民日报》发文关注尊界刹车踏板支架断裂事件……</a><br/>《亮见》<a href="https://chinadigitaltimes.net/chinese/732811.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">给民族工业一点时间，谁给生命一个机会？</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/oIu9MD_WjopiKCC9QxuTVrYcU-R5Kklqg4Y0iDzx6oyo2sAKBJS_N68inCU4J2gXzabmLDUfnNk_AH0fyTwBW0GA4PLY5gM7FdFG3136ZtdzlPIV8Xb3a2cTeo-Y_UIIVFW30gRCLNBlRGZd0wrZsfwp5df4tZAp-wAgrYLmqIOoj-1mQ7v8KXvjaOjabgozW0D7bhblEnKbMaxssT_GoG0xWqFUkvbEE2zSedoNdaMHz978Se91HHx3kLo3x8p4ganY-5gPo_ylRgM3AxT2Fu0L8fl4RsUcsHmXeSXeZCvi1z4MDUfmGBjg87Eiwxz9de0p5qD64Yc9apde0tySMw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/eJhVYD8eNqFWd9qXWfhAnwbGN78t_1lvauF6x5gtcx9Z_65QlA1SdiqPbW0ECVt3LVigVPXV0lHcWY_xGysm9JOuC_kk_mFfSGOLlVgfPiqq0H6hgtBsfVQh1__44kiGDqqmEwc3DBH9oJc3TKfkfe0DOmXu8Un9DNwBUtmArPQo6N4cR5MmNTsnxrJSmyVA4nWvq_Vi0BMsZXqtXzOIBnj8zp6u5qnzjwGeN5PcrqHtX1HLZdZ9X1ETfKpvJXyMs8LITYQoo3TbT8p_vkTdb2x5_Z-fsCSzQGv1gkBX-LG96JowPVfur60UXEjFYV5xupsMT8SQrbE4-YrAaR55-g.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/mUkgScD7ydHO9lgx4C5KUmCi_uVNORofRi4k96RMOr0wZvlgLH5MfNG5xNqzCGFpKBV-ZtBF870ea-FTxwa8OfiX4wn3wXDuYFqDAjCv4WWS-QgNKZFaD4qgWGFGjTPnt1qrrTMQbjf_QiTYvUy_HInT_J-xQbbRgprhBeQ-l5090TRu0ZjOkdvDQ12ZOkKBm_vcOlSb-LuEwJGXmjogByQZJ8AeZTrvfQoAM_Z0BI774DPe3g1wz3pLHKyuyafoKNs0VQvH9Rb9lG5zu33BJ_N_xP2ul0XEdaBANIlNh4xuivunpptkA45qZVuEkfz1zwsr7PrOgv8PV9zcSoOoxw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/F39og7jnoBa5IQiJe5qYSXebDGy434Wptpx50sk9gqzNLihQKVlLTRJT9x0a4pOy0DxvAZYInG8nCBPxYr1OEC1m2YWCPfi_dCeqIve38V4mTlEGwSE67c_OFQcdD4hTiG4kvEOVjuIPtF_I2_GLKAnG-zzpTb2ZkwvXLiPCXzc1wFEqoVOFR9ChhGY8zAUWKg4ZUka7ltl9My4sh-Kck2UgbRT_xBcMR9F7KwdxmHRBoMKI8iM63_mqyKalcC3MKiT7e02xTMYNPZbO4_Xt